@startuml
title State Diagram 1 - Overall System

skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 90
skinparam ranksep 110

[*] --> Starting : user opens app
Starting : entry/open database
Starting : entry/show splash
Starting -right-> Error : database\ncannot be opened
Error --> [*]
Starting --> SignedOut : database ready

SignedOut --> SignedOut : login failed\n/ show error
SignedOut --> CustomerWorkspace : customer logs in\nor registers
SignedOut --> AgentWorkspace : agent logs in
SignedOut --> AdminWorkspace : admin logs in
CustomerWorkspace : entry/show promotion\nif unseen this month

CustomerWorkspace -up-> SignedOut : logout
AgentWorkspace -up-> SignedOut : logout
AdminWorkspace -up-> SignedOut : logout

CustomerWorkspace --> ShuttingDown : window closed
AgentWorkspace --> ShuttingDown : window closed
AdminWorkspace --> ShuttingDown : window closed
SignedOut -right-> ShuttingDown : window closed
ShuttingDown : do/save database
ShuttingDown : exit/release lock
ShuttingDown --> [*]

@enduml
